== Effects ==
* Drops a random [[Cards_and_Runes#Major_Arcana_Cards|tarot card]] on pickup.
* {{dlc|nr}} Adds an extra effect to a card, rune, or other card-like pickup.
** {{dlc|r}} Adds an extra effect to certain tarot cards.

=== Effects ===
'''Items not listed do not benefit from Tarot Cloth.'''
* {{dlc|r}}{{p|I - The Magician}}: Gives {{I|The Book of Belial}} effect on top of [[Tear Effects#Homing|homing]].
* {{dlc|r}}{{p|II - The High Priestess}}: Another foot strikes down shortly after the first.
* {{p|III - The Empress}}: Doubles the [[speed]] increase and quadruples the [[damage]] increase.
* {{dlc|r}}{{p|IV - The Emperor}}: If the boss has not yet been defeated, grants a {{e|Soul Heart}} on top of teleporting Isaac.
* {{p|V - The Hierophant}}: Spawns {{dlc|nr}}four or {{dlc|r}}three {{e|Soul Heart}}s.
* {{p|VI - The Lovers}}: Spawns {{dlc|nr}}four or {{dlc|r}}three {{e|Red Heart}}s.
* {{p|VII - The Chariot}}: Doubles the duration of the [[Temporary Buffs#Invulnerability|invulnerability]].
* {{p|VIII - Justice}}: Spawns twice as many [[pickups]].
* {{dlc|r}}{{p|IX - The Hermit}}: Prevents {{E|Greed}}/{{E|Super Greed}} from spawning in the shop. If the shop was already entered and Greed/Super Greed was fought, using the card turns it into a normal shop. (Does not create a working shop in the [[Mirrored World]].)
* {{p|X - Wheel of Fortune}}: Spawns two {{M|Slot Machine}}s.
* {{p|XI - Strength}}: Doubles the stat increases, but the [[damage]] multiplier applies only once.
* {{p|XIII - Death}}: Deals 80 damage to all enemies in the room.
* {{p|XIV - Temperance}}: Spawns two {{M|Blood Donation Machine}}s.
* {{dlc|r}}{{p|XV - The Devil}}: Damage increase is doubled.
* {{p|XVI - The Tower}}: Spawns 13 {{e|Troll Bomb}}s. <!-- It is 13, not 12. That's the effect. -->
* {{dlc+|r}}{{p|XVII - The Stars}}: If the treasure room was not entered before, it will have two items to choose from, as if {{i|More Options}} was active. This will not work if the card teleports you to a {{R|Planetarium}}.{{dlc-}}
* {{p|XIX - The Sun}}: Deals {{dlc|nr}}200 damage or {{dlc|r}}400 damage to all enemies in the room.
* {{p|XX - Judgement}}: Spawns two Beggars.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|2 of Clubs}}: Quadruples Isaac's {{e|Bomb}}s.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|2 of Diamonds}}: Quadruples Isaac's {{e|Penny|text=Coins}}.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|2 of Spades}}: Quadruples Isaac's {{e|Key}}s.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|2 of Hearts}}: Quadruples Isaac's {{e|Red Heart}}s.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|Suicide King}}: Spawns twice as many pickups/items/{{E|Chest}}s.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|? Card}}: Activates the effect of Isaac's active item twice.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|Ancient Recall}}: Spawns 6 cards.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|Algiz}}: Doubles the duration of the shield, making it last a full minute.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|Berkano}}: Spawns 6 Blue Flies and 6 Blue Spiders.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|Dagaz}}: Removes any curses from the current floor and grants two {{e|Soul Heart}}s.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|Jera}}: Quadruples all pickups and chests in the room.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|Perthro}}: Instantly re-rolls items twice, essentially removing an extra item from the item pool.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|Blank Rune}}: Activates two random rune effects. Attempts to spawn additional Blank Rune twice.
* {{dlc|nr}}{{p|Black Rune}}: Deals 80 damage to all enemies in the room. Other effects are unchanged.
* {{p|0 - The Fool?}}: Drops Isaac's 6 most recently collected items on the floor, alongside pickups. Does not affect quest items (e.g. {{I|The Polaroid}}) or {{I|Missing No.}}.
* {{p|III - The Empress?}}: Adds a total of three temporary [[Health#Red Heart Containers|heart containers]].
* {{p|V - The Hierophant?}}: Spawns 3 {{e|Bone Heart}}s.
* {{p|VI - The Lovers?}}: Removes 2 [[Health#Red_Heart_Containers|heart containers]] or 4 {{e|Soul Heart}}s, adds 2 [[Health#Broken Hearts|broken hearts]] and spawns 2 items.
* {{p|VIII - Justice?}}: Spawns 4-14 {{E|Locked Chest}}s.
* {{p|IX - The Hermit?}}: Spawns 1 additional {{e|Penny}}.
* {{p|X - Wheel of Fortune?}}: Invokes an additional {{r|Dice Room}} effect.
* {{p|XII - The Hanged Man?}}: Doubles the effect's duration.
* {{p|XIV - Temperance?}}: Forces Isaac to eat 10 pills.
* {{p|XVI - The Tower?}}: Spawns 14 rock clusters.
* {{p|XVII - The Stars?}}: Removes 2 items and spawns 4.
* {{p|XX - Judgement?}}: Spawns two {{M|Shop Restock Machine}}s.

== Notes ==
* Tarot Cloth's effect also applies to card effects used through {{i|Blank Card}}.
** {{dlc|r}} Only certain cards gain the Tarot Cloth effect with Blank Card, which include: {{p|I - The Magician}}, {{p|II - The High Priestess}}, {{p|III - The Empress}}, {{p|IV - The Emperor}}, {{p|V - The Hierophant}}, {{p|VI - The Lovers}}, {{p|VII - The Chariot}}, {{p|VIII - Justice}}, {{p|IX - The Hermit}}, {{p|XVII - The Stars}}, {{p|XIX - The Sun}}, {{p|0 - The Fool?}}, {{p|III - The Empress?}}, {{p|V - The Hierophant?}}, {{p|VI - The Lovers?}}, {{p|VIII - Justice?}}, and {{p|XIV - Temperance?}}
*** Three of these cards will have diminished Tarot Cloth effects:
**** {{p|XIX - The Sun}}: Only 200 damage is dealt.
**** {{p|0 - The Fool?}}: Only 3 items drop instead of 6; this also applies with {{I|Car Battery}}.
**** {{p|VIII - Justice?}}: Only 2-7 chests spawn.
** As a result, using the Blank Card in conjunction with the {{i|Car Battery}} will cause the effect of the active card to quadruple, instead of double.
*** {{dlc|r}} Only certain effects will be doubled again, which include: {{p|I - The Magician}} (only the damage up), {{p|III - The Empress}}, {{p|IV - The Emperor}} (only the soul hearts), {{p|V - The Hierophant}}, {{p|VI - The Lovers}}, {{p|VII - The Chariot}}, {{p|VIII - Justice}}, {{p|V - The Hierophant?}}, {{p|VI - The Lovers?}}, and {{p|XIV - Temperance?}}.
* {{dlc|r}} The enhanced effect of The Fool? can't drop starting items in [[challenges]] on the ground.
* {{dlc|r}} With a {{p|IX - The Hermit}} card, it is usually best to walk into the shop first. If Greed is there, he can be fought for money, and then the card can be used to restock the shop.

